1
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:03,233
If you don't want to live in the village

2
00:00:03,766 --> 00:00:05,166
Renting a place in town is fine too

3
00:00:05,366 --> 00:00:05,833
No, no, no

4
00:00:05,866 --> 00:00:06,600
We're not renting

5
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:07,700
We don't want to be a burden

6
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:09,200
We'll just sleep at the farm

7
00:00:09,366 --> 00:00:10,033
We can sleep anywhere

8
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:11,266
We can also help you with the work

9
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:12,200
We can't be freeloaders

10
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:12,866
Yeah

11
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:14,733
I heard all your workers left

12
00:00:14,733 --> 00:00:15,666
You must be short on hands

13
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,033
Your dad and I are still fit

14
00:00:17,166 --> 00:00:18,166
We can help you out

15
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:21,166
I'll leave Mom and Dad with you

16
00:00:24,266 --> 00:00:24,766
Daniel

17
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:25,733
Why are you running so fast

18
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:28,933
I'm sorry

19
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:29,900
For causing you trouble

20
00:00:29,966 --> 00:00:30,466
It's fine

21
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,166
I was just worrying about having no workers

22
00:00:32,166 --> 00:00:33,266
And being overwhelmed with work these days

23
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,000
Then Mom and Dad came just in time

24
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:35,566
This is definitely not that simple

25
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:36,766
Let's see

26
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,966
What kind of tricks you're playing this time

27
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:45,500
Sweetie

28
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:46,400
I heard that Lewes

29
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:47,566
Created a secret recipe

30
00:00:47,633 --> 00:00:49,066
That makes the forest frogs grow super fast

31
00:00:49,266 --> 00:00:50,000
And a big boss

32
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:51,233
Wants to buy it at a high price

33
00:00:51,566 --> 00:00:52,100
Yeah

34
00:00:52,866 --> 00:00:53,466
But

35
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:54,400
Lewes didn't sell it

36
00:00:54,466 --> 00:00:55,933
Do you know the recipe

37
00:00:56,633 --> 00:00:57,233
Of course
